      "music": "Gym Leader Challenge Battle (Pokemon Card GB2 - Duel Vs Fortress Leader)",
      "meet_text": "I'm Brock, leader of Pewter Gym, and the Gym Challenge starts here with me. I lead with a rock hard defence. Are you ready to face my rock hard defence deck? Remember, the banned trainer cards aren't allowed in here.",
