      "first_win_text": "Heh, you cracked right through my defence! You've earned the right to move on. Take this coin.",
      "rematch_win_text": "Still as solid as ever, but you're the stronger one.",
      "loss_text": "The best offense is a good defense! That's my way of doing things. Come back when your rocks are harder!",
      "pattern": "idle_down",
